					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/employees/certificate.do">제증명서
							발급</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/employees/certificate-register.do">제증명서
							발급대장</a></li>
				</ul></li>
			<li class="main-nav__item"><a class="main-nav__trigger"
				href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}//attendance/attendance-management.do">근태관리</a>
				<ul class="dropdown-menu">
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/attendance/attendance-management.do">근태기록/관리</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
