					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/attendance/day-worker-inquiry.do">일용직
							근무 조회</a></li>
				</ul></li>
			<li class="main-nav__item"><a class="main-nav__trigger"
				href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/management.do">급여관리</a>
				<ul class="dropdown-menu">
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/management.do">급여입력/관리</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/day-worker-management.do">급여입력/관리(일용직)</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/register.do">급여대장</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/payslip.do">급여명세서</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/employee-history.do">사원별
							급여내역</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/item-ledger.do">항목별
							대장</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll/four-insurance.do">4대보험
							공제내역</a></li>
				</ul></li>
			<li class="main-nav__item"><a class="main-nav__trigger"
				href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/example.do?menu=statistics">급여통계</a>
				<ul class="dropdown-menu">
					
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll-stats/annual.do">연도별
							전체급여 통계</a></li>
					<li><a class="dropdown-menu__link"
						href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/payroll-stats/monthly.do">월별
